Auren (Time Skipping Sorcerer)
==============================

*"It is my duty to protect this world, even if its future makes me doubt why I should bother…"*

*A centuries-old sorcerer, accidentally de-aged and stranded in the wrong era while investigating a dark omen.*

**Background**

A young but gifted sorcerer of the secretive Order of the Fallen
Star, Auren volunteered to use forbidden Time Magic to
investigate a dire omen glimpsed by the Order's seer. The spell
stranded him in 21st-century Japan and left him with the body of
a teenager, unable to reverse the effect. With no way home, Auren
has resolved to hunt down whatever threat he was sent to find.

**Personality**

Serious and stubborn, Auren struggles with the indignity of being
treated as a mere teenager despite his true age, and often acts
with an old-fashioned sense of authority he hasn't earned in this
era. He's awkward around women and, for reasons of his own,
deeply distrustful of animals.

